{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"南非","country_iso":"ZAF","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:05:15.651073","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"ZAF-ES-0002","ldc":"No","location":"北开普省, 西开普省","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"南非绿洲储能项目群一期","project_name_en":"South Africa Oasis Energy Storage Project Cluster Phase I","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"东南非区域总部","content":"当地时间11月20日，中国电建南非绿洲储能项目群一期顺利实现融资关闭，标志着项目正式进入实施阶段。\n该项目是南非政府第一轮储能IPP招标项目，购电方为南非国家电力公司（Eskom），主导开发方为法国电力集团（EDF）。中国电建于2024年10月16日与EDF签署项目EPC和运维合同。项目分为三个标段，分别为位于南非北开普省安格内斯、穆科迪和西开普省安格内斯，总装机257兆瓦。项目建成后可为提高南非电网稳定性发挥重要作用，助力南非可再生能源发展。\n该项目的顺利落地进一步巩固了中国电建在南非新能源建设领域的优势。中国电建将继续发挥自身优势，为南非绿色能源转型和经济社会发展做出贡献。","content_sha256":"4edaa7e00ea3dacc7a908d75f37cc77ffd825a7a46d4e2bbaedfdbc81fca0e64","id":5776,"publish_date":"2024-11-24 16:59:04","title":"中国电建南非绿洲储能项目群一期实现融资关闭","title_sha256":"ba3470fa9c14638372818d4f240c091d13f3792514c2d4e581042ecd20d9b5f5","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/75209.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"ZAF-ES-0002","capacity_details":"BESS: 257MW","capacity_mw":257.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"257","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:05:15.651367","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"ZAF-ES-0002-01","investment_date":"2024-11-20","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.powerchina-intl.com/show/9/3963.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"法国电力集团; 南非国家电力公司","project_developer_en":"EDF Group; Eskom Holdings SOC Ltd","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"中国电建在南非参与了绿洲储能项目群一期项目，该项目总装机257兆瓦，旨在提高南非